swarm-core provides CMake targets:

    find_package(swarm-core CONFIG REQUIRED)
    target_link_libraries(main PRIVATE swarm::core)

Headers: #include "swarm-ports.h" (include/swarm-core/), the testbench as
#include "testbench/swarm-testbench.h". Before 1.0 any minor may break the
API: pin a version (README "Versions").
